{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q944244","formula":"C₁₈H₂₉NO₂","hill":"C18H29NO2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":29.0,"N":1.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Penbutolol","uk":"Пенбутолол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Penbutolol (brand names Levatol, Levatolol, Lobeta, Paginol, Hostabloc, Betapressin) is a medication in the class of beta blockers, used in the treatment of high blood pressure. Penbutolol is able to bind to both beta-1 adrenergic receptors and beta-2 adrenergic receptors (the two subtypes), thus making it a non-selective β blocker. Penbutolol is a sympathomimetic drug with properties allowing it to act as a partial agonist at β adrenergic receptors.","uk":"Пенбутолол (англ. Penbutolol, лат. Penbutololum), який продається під торговими марками «Леватол», «Леватолол», «Лобета», «Пагінол», «Хостаблок», «Бетапрессин» — препарат із класу бета-блокаторів, що використовується для лікування артеріальної гіпертензії."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":37464,"mass":291.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)(C)NC[C@@H](COC1=CC=CC=C1C2CCCC2)O","inchikey":"KQXKVJAGOJTNJS-HNNXBMFYSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-1-(tert-butylamino)-3-(2-cyclopentylphenoxy)propan-2-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"37464","atoms":50,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.143,"y":-0.615,"z":0.163,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.784,"y":1.512,"z":1.885,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.664,"y":-0.273,"z":0.4,"el":"N"},{"x":2.193,"y":1.003,"z":-0.22,"el":"C"},{"x":3.037,"y":1.658,"z":0.888,"el":"C"},{"x":2.706,"y":1.603,"z":-1.545,"el":"C"},{"x":3.62,"y":2.905,"z":0.243,"el":"C"},{"x":3.918,"y":2.45,"z":-1.175,"el":"C"},{"x":2.23,"y":-0.508,"z":-0.159,"el":"C"},{"x":1.065,"y":-1.245,"z":0.028,"el":"C"},{"x":3.452,"y":-1.167,"z":-0.294,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.604,"y":0.11,"z":-0.658,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.674,"y":0.406,"z":1.706,"el":"C